# Diagrams use Archify

When the user asks for an architecture, flowchart, sequence, data-flow, lifecycle, state, entity-relationship, or similar diagram:

- Use the Archify skill. Read its current skill file and follow it.
- Do not hand-write SVG, Mermaid, or HTML as the diagram.
- Discussion can stay in text until a diagram is requested. Once it is requested, produce it with Archify.
